[2026-05-10 11:21:37] local.INFO: [{"id":2,"title":"Amazon UK","description":"Amazon UK","discount":0,"only_denominations":false,"redemption_instructions":"Amazon.com Gift Cards never expire and can be redeemed towards millions of items at www.amazon.com To redeem your gift card, follow these steps: . Visit www.amazon.com\/redeem . Enter the Claim Code when prompted. . Gift card funds will be applied automatically to eligible orders during the checkout process. . You must pay for any remaining balance on your order with another payment method. Your gift card claim code may also be entered when prompted during checkout. To redeem your gift card using the Amazon.com service, first add the gift card funds to Your Account. If you have questions about redeeming your gift card, please visit www.amazon.co.uk\/gc-redeem","min":1,"max":76.64,"denominations":[],"issuing_pc":1,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":12,"title":"App Store & iTunes UK","description":"App Store & iTunes UK","discount":0,"only_denominations":false,"redemption_instructions":"How to Use Your Apple Gift Card\n\nWhere You Can Use It\n\nThe Apple Gift Card can be used for purchases at:\n \u2022 Apple Stores (in-person or online at apple.com).\n \u2022 Apple Store app.\n \u2022 Apple services, including the App Store, iTunes, Apple Music, Apple TV, Apple News, Apple Books, Apple Arcade, iCloud, and other Apple properties.\n \u2022 Apple products like iPhone, iPad, AirPods, MacBook, accessories, and more.\n\nHow to Redeem Your Gift Card\n\n 1. Online Purchases:\n \u2022 Go to apple.com\/redeem and add the gift card to your Apple Account balance.\n 2. In-Store Purchases:\n \u2022 Bring this email with the gift card details to any Apple Store location.\n\nImportant Information\n\n \u2022 No Returns or Refunds: Apple Gift Cards are non-refundable and cannot be exchanged.\n \u2022 Scam Warning: Never share your gift card code.\n \u2022 Restrictions:\n \u2022 Valid only for U.S. transactions on Apple properties.\n \u2022 Not redeemable at Apple resellers or for cash, except as required by law.\n \u2022 Cannot be resold, refunded, or exchanged.\n \u2022 Apple is not responsible for unauthorized use of the card.\n\nTerms and Support\n\n \u2022 Full terms and conditions apply.\n \u2022 For assistance, visit support.apple.com\/giftcard or call 1-800-275-2273.\n\nEnjoy your Apple products and services!","min":2,"max":76.64,"denominations":[],"issuing_pc":1,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":19361,"title":"Asda UK","description":"Asda UK","discount":0,"only_denominations":false,"redemption_instructions":"Online:\nYou can use your gift card to pay for purchases on groceries.asda.com and on George.com. Simply add the gift card number and the PIN in the gift card section at check out.\nInstore:\nPresent printed giftcard or mobile giftcard at checkout to cashier.\nFor full terms and conditions please visit: \nhttps:\/\/cards.asda.com\/\nconditions-of-use: https:\/\/cards.asda.com\/conditions-of-use","min":1,"max":76.64,"denominations":[],"issuing_pc":1,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":3942,"title":"Google play UK","description":"Google play UK","discount":0,"only_denominations":false,"redemption_instructions":"Use this gift card code on Google Play. Any other request for the code may bea scam. To redeem, enter code in the Play Store app or https:\/\/play.google.com\/store See play.google.com\/us-card-terms for full terms. Usable for purchases of eligible items on Google Play only. Not usable for hardware and certain subscriptions. Other limits may apply. No fees or expiration dates. Except as required by law, card is not redeemable for cash or other cards not reloadable or refundable cannot be combined with other non-Google Play balances in your Google Payments account, resold, exchanged or transferred for value.","min":1,"max":76.64,"denominations":[],"issuing_pc":1,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":20495,"title":"Mastercard Prepaid Reward (\u00a31 to \u00a3150) GB","description":"Mastercard Prepaid Reward (\u00a31 to \u00a3150) GB","discount":0,"only_denominations":false,"redemption_instructions":"Description:\nUse your Prepaid Mastercard anywhere Mastercard is accepted around the world. 12-month expiration. Digital only.\n\nTerms & Conditions:\nUse your card everywhere Mastercard is accepted. Mastercard is a registered trademark and the circles design is a trademark of Mastercard International Incorporated. This card is issued by Transact Payments Limited pursuant to licences by Mastercard International. Transact Payments Limited is authorised and regulated by the Gibraltar Financial Services Commission. Your use of the prepaid card is governed by the Cardholder Agreement, and some fees may apply. This is not a gift card. Please note that prepaid cards are subject to expiration, so pay close attention to the expiration date of the card.","min":1,"max":76.64,"denominations":[],"issuing_pc":0,"issuing_fc":0,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":19312,"title":"Matalan UK","description":"Matalan UK","discount":0,"only_denominations":false,"redemption_instructions":"1. To use your e-gift card in-store simply present a copy of the barcode above, via mobile device or print out, when making a purchase.\n2. To use your e-gift card online simply enter the E-Gift Number and PIN above during online checkout.\nPlease keep your e-gift number safe. 1. The Matalan e-gift card is redeemable in full or part payment for merchandise from all Matalan Stores within the UK or online at www.matalan.co.uk.\n2. Matalan e-gift cards can be ordered online with a minimum value of \u00a310 and have a maximum value of \u00a3200.\n3. Matalan e-gift cards may not be exchanged for cash.\n4. Matalan cannot be held liable for e-Gift cards, once activated, which are subsequently lost, stolen, damaged or defaced.\n5. No change or refund will be given but any remaining balance may be\napplied to future purchases.\n6. The e-Gift card will expire 24 months after the last use or balance enquiry and any remaining balance will be deducted.\n7. Matalan e-Gift cards are not cheque guarantee, credit or charge cards.\n8. By activating and\/or redeeming a Matalan e-Gift Card you accept and agree to these terms and conditions.","min":1,"max":76.64,"denominations":[],"issuing_pc":0,"issuing_fc":0,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":15364,"title":"Netflix UK","description":"Netflix UK","discount":1,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"To start watching, Go to http:\/\/www.netflix.com\/code, Enter the code Valid only towards the Netflix streaming service via Netflix Account (18+ to be a member), in countries where the service is offered in US dollars. Entire value credited to your Netflix account upon redemption. Nonrefundable or redeemable for cash, except where required by law. Does not expire. No resale.","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[25],"issuing_pc":0,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":18711,"title":"Nintendo Switch GB","description":"Nintendo Switch GB","discount":0,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"How to Redeem Your Nordstrom Gift Card\nWhere You Can Redeem\n\n \u2022 In Stores: Nordstrom and Nordstrom Rack locations in the U.S.\n \u2022 Online: Nordstrom.com, NordstromRack.com, and HauteLook.com.\n\nShopping Online\n\n 1. At checkout, select Apply a Gift Card in the payment section.\n 2. Enter the eGift Card number and access code, then click Apply.\n 3. Note: Only one gift card can be redeemed on NordstromRack.com and HauteLook.com. To use multiple gift cards, combine their balances before checkout.\n\nShopping In Stores\n\n 1. Present your eGift Card at checkout:\n \u2022 Have the salesperson scan it directly from your mobile device, or\n \u2022 Print the card and hand it to the salesperson.\n\nImportant Information\n\n \u2022 This prepaid gift card cannot be returned, used as payment on an account, or redeemed for cash (except where required by law).\n \u2022 For full terms and conditions or to check your balance, visit Nordstrom.com\/giftcards, call 1.877.283.4045, or inquire at any Nordstrom store register.\n\nEnjoy shopping with Nordstrom!","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[6.99,17.99],"issuing_pc":0,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":15388,"title":"Nintendo Switch Online UK","description":"Nintendo Switch Online UK","discount":1.2,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"How to Redeem Your Nordstrom Gift Card\nWhere You Can Redeem\n\n \u2022 In Stores: Nordstrom and Nordstrom Rack locations in the U.S.\n \u2022 Online: Nordstrom.com, NordstromRack.com, and HauteLook.com.\n\nShopping Online\n\n 1. At checkout, select Apply a Gift Card in the payment section.\n 2. Enter the eGift Card number and access code, then click Apply.\n 3. Note: Only one gift card can be redeemed on NordstromRack.com and HauteLook.com. To use multiple gift cards, combine their balances before checkout.\n\nShopping In Stores\n\n 1. Present your eGift Card at checkout:\n \u2022 Have the salesperson scan it directly from your mobile device, or\n \u2022 Print the card and hand it to the salesperson.\n\nImportant Information\n\n \u2022 This prepaid gift card cannot be returned, used as payment on an account, or redeemed for cash (except where required by law).\n \u2022 For full terms and conditions or to check your balance, visit Nordstrom.com\/giftcards, call 1.877.283.4045, or inquire at any Nordstrom store register.\n\nEnjoy shopping with Nordstrom!","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[6.99,17.99],"issuing_pc":0,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":15403,"title":"Nintendo eShop Card UK","description":"Nintendo eShop Card UK","discount":1.5,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"How to Redeem Your Nordstrom Gift Card\nWhere You Can Redeem\n\n \u2022 In Stores: Nordstrom and Nordstrom Rack locations in the U.S.\n \u2022 Online: Nordstrom.com, NordstromRack.com, and HauteLook.com.\n\nShopping Online\n\n 1. At checkout, select Apply a Gift Card in the payment section.\n 2. Enter the eGift Card number and access code, then click Apply.\n 3. Note: Only one gift card can be redeemed on NordstromRack.com and HauteLook.com. To use multiple gift cards, combine their balances before checkout.\n\nShopping In Stores\n\n 1. Present your eGift Card at checkout:\n \u2022 Have the salesperson scan it directly from your mobile device, or\n \u2022 Print the card and hand it to the salesperson.\n\nImportant Information\n\n \u2022 This prepaid gift card cannot be returned, used as payment on an account, or redeemed for cash (except where required by law).\n \u2022 For full terms and conditions or to check your balance, visit Nordstrom.com\/giftcards, call 1.877.283.4045, or inquire at any Nordstrom store register.\n\nEnjoy shopping with Nordstrom!","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[15,25,50,75],"issuing_pc":1,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":8625,"title":"PlayStation UK","description":"PlayStation UK","discount":1,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"This card may be redeemed through PlayStation Store on a PS4, PS3, and PS Vita system, or a personal computer. . Open a Sony Entertainment Network account or use an existing account. . From your PS4, PS3, or PS Vita system, or a personal computer, access PlayStation Store. . Click the Redeem Codes icon. . Enter the code at the bottom of this card. Please note that the code is case sensitive and must be entered exactly as displayed. . For additional redemption instructions, please visit https:\/\/www.playstation.com\/en-us\/explore\/playstationnetwork\/redemption Your use of this PlayStation Plus code constitutes your acceptance of these terms and any additional terms available at http:\/\/us.playstation.com\/redemption. PSN SM and PlayStation Plus offerings may change without notice.","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[10,20,40,50,70],"issuing_pc":0,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":15606,"title":"Racingbreaks.com UK","description":"Racingbreaks.com UK","discount":1.2,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"To redeem code go to https:\/\/www.racingbreaks.com\/","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[25,50],"issuing_pc":0,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":15814,"title":"Swarovski UK","description":"Swarovski UK","discount":1.5,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"To redeem code go to https:\/\/www.swarovski.com\/en-FI\/.","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[20,25,50],"issuing_pc":0,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":19313,"title":"Tesco UK","description":"Tesco UK","discount":0,"only_denominations":false,"redemption_instructions":"To redeem online: You can redeem your Tesco Digital Gift Card online at tesco.com.\nJust select the gift card payment option and enter your Card Number and PIN at the online checkout.\nTo redeem in-store: You can spend your Tesco Digital Gift Card at any Tesco store or Tesco direct desk. Simply print it out and present at the till.\nAvailable balance is shown on your till receipt, at giftcard.tesco.com or by calling 08450 757 757.\nA credit\/debit card is required for online processing and identification purposes. You must be aged 18 or over to use online.\nGift cards cannot be exchanged for cash\/credit. The card and balance will expire four years from purchase or last use.\nGift cards are valuable and should be treated like cash. If lost they cannot be replaced. Damaged, altered or cancelled cards will not be accepted. giftcard.tesco.com Treat this digital gift card like cash, lost or stolen digital gift cards cannot be replaced. Redeem at any UK Tesco store. Excludes purchases from Tesco Petrol Stations. You can check your available balance at any Tesco store or by calling 03450 757 757. Digital gift cards cannot be exchanged for cash or credit. The digital gift card and balance will expire five years from purchase or last digital gift card use. Damaged, altered or cancelled digital gift cards will not be accepted.","min":0.5,"max":76.64,"denominations":[],"issuing_pc":1,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":18744,"title":"Tinder Plus & Gold GB","description":"Tinder Plus & Gold GB","discount":0,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"Redeem Instruction:\n\"How to Redeem\nVisit Tinder.com and sign into your account\nTap the profile icon\nScroll down and tap Promo Code\nEnter your promo code and hit Submit\nIf asked, enter your credit card information, and continue. 36 months from issue date\"\n\nTerms & Conditions: \n\"Terms and Conditions\nCheck if your country is supported under this gift card code before purchasing.\n\nSupported Countries:\n\nAustralia\nIsrael\nJapan\nUnited Kingdom & British Virgin Islands\n\nVouchers are subject to expiry and are valid for a period of sixty (60) days from the date of purchase.\"","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[7.99,19.99],"issuing_pc":1,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643},{"id":15857,"title":"Xbox UK","description":"Xbox UK","discount":1.5,"only_denominations":true,"redemption_instructions":"Redeem at https:\/\/www.microsoft.com\/redeem To play on PC: after redeeming, follow instructions at https:\/\/www.xbox.com\/pcgamesplan. Game titles and number vary overtime and by country. If your membership terminates or a game is removed, you must reactivate your membership or buy the game to continue using any add-ons or items purchased for a game. ISP fees and age restrictions apply. Except as required by law, codes are nonrefundable.","min":null,"max":null,"denominations":[5,10,15,25,50],"issuing_pc":1,"issuing_fc":1,"charge_phase":"after_conversion","tier_pricing":0,"issuing_tiers":[],"rate":1.427643}]  
